---
// Footer V03 — ruhiger Newsletter-Streifen oben, klare Navigation, YouTube als Icon
---

<footer class="footer-fokus">
  <!-- Newsletter-Streifen: ein ruhiger Block, Text links / Feld rechts -->
  <div class="footer-news-strip">
    <div class="container footer-news-inner">
      <div class="footer-news-text">
        <h4>Newsletter</h4>
        <p>Jede Woche laden wir dich zu unserem Sonntagsgespräch ein — dazu immer wieder Impulse für deinen Alltag.</p>
      </div>
      <!-- TODO: Formular an Quentn/Mail-Tool anbinden. Aktuell ohne Versand. -->
      <form class="footer-news-form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault();">
        <input type="email" placeholder="deine@email.de" aria-label="E-Mail-Adresse" required />
        <button type="submit">Eintragen</button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Navigation -->
  <div class="container footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <img src="/img/logo.svg" alt="Himmelstoß Coaching" class="footer-logo" />
      <p>Annette &amp; Herbert Himmelstoß<br>Coaches für ein lebendiges Leben</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-col">
      <h4>Angebote</h4>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/angebote">Alle Angebote →</a></li>
        <li><a href="/buch">Unser Buch →</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-col">
      <h4>Kontakt</h4>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="mailto:kontakt@himmelstosscoaching.de">kontakt@himmelstosscoaching.de</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://orientierungsgespraech-himmelstoss.youcanbook.me" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Orientierungsgespräch</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-col">
      <h4>Folgen</h4>
      <a class="footer-yt" href="https://www.youtube.com/@himmelstosscoaching/streams" target="_blank" rel="noopener" aria-label="Unser YouTube-Kanal mit den Sonntagsgesprächen">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path fill="#FF0000" d="M23.498 6.186a3.016 3.016 0 0 0-2.122-2.136C19.505 3.545 12 3.545 12 3.545s-7.505 0-9.377.505A3.017 3.017 0 0 0 .502 6.186C0 8.07 0 12 0 12s0 3.93.502 5.814a3.016 3.016 0 0 0 2.122 2.136c1.871.505 9.376.505 9.376.505s7.505 0 9.377-.505a3.015 3.015 0 0 0 2.122-2.136C24 15.93 24 12 24 12s0-3.93-.502-5.814z"/>
          <path fill="#fff" d="M9.545 15.568V8.432L15.818 12l-6.273 3.568z"/>
        </svg>
        <span>Sonntagsgespräche</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="footer-bottom">
    <div class="container footer-bottom-inner">
      <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} Himmelstoß Coaching</span>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/impressum">Impressum</a></li>
        <li><a href="/datenschutz">Datenschutz</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<style>
  .footer-fokus {
    background: var(--bg-cream-deeper);
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    position: relative;
  }
  .footer-fokus::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 3px;
    background: var(--sun-strip);
    opacity: 0.5;
  }

  /* Newsletter-Streifen */
  .footer-news-strip {
    padding: 44px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(184, 149, 107, 0.28);
  }
  .footer-news-inner {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 36px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .footer-news-text { max-width: 480px; }
  .footer-news-text h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--orange);
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .footer-news-text p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
  }
  .footer-news-form {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .footer-news-form input {
    width: 230px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-button);
    border: 1px solid rgba(184, 149, 107, 0.5);
    background: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--blue-deep);
    outline: none;
  }
  .footer-news-form input::placeholder { color: var(--ink-light); }
  .footer-news-form input:focus { border-color: var(--orange); }
  .footer-news-form button {
    padding: 12px 22px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-button);
    border: none;
    background: var(--lachs);
    color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    cursor: pointer;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: background .2s;
  }
  .footer-news-form button:hover { background: var(--orange); }

  /* Navigation */
  .footer-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.8fr 1fr 1.4fr 1.1fr;
    gap: 50px;
    padding: 84px 0 64px;
  }
  .footer-logo { height: 44px; width: auto; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .footer-brand p { margin: 0; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink-soft); line-height: 1.55; }
  .footer-yt {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color .2s;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .footer-yt:hover { color: var(--blue-deep); }
  .footer-yt svg { flex-shrink: 0; }

  .footer-col h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--orange);
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .footer-col ul { list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
  .footer-col li { margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 15px; }
  .footer-col a { color: var(--ink-soft); text-decoration: none; transition: color .2s; }
  .footer-col a:hover { color: var(--blue-deep); text-decoration: none; }

  .footer-bottom {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(184, 149, 107, 0.3);
    padding: 22px 0;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .footer-bottom-inner {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .footer-bottom ul { display: flex; gap: 24px; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
  .footer-bottom a { color: var(--ink-light); text-decoration: none; }
  .footer-bottom a:hover { color: var(--blue-deep); }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .footer-news-inner { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 18px; }
    .footer-news-form { width: 100%; }
    .footer-news-form input { flex: 1; width: auto; }
    .footer-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 40px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 540px) {
    .footer-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .footer-news-form { flex-direction: column; }
    .footer-news-form input { width: 100%; }
    .footer-news-form button { width: 100%; }
  }
</style>
